[engl]
{100}{}{Alexei}
{200}{}{You see Alexei.}
{210}{}{You see Alexei, he's guarding the "bridge" across the moat.}
{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{No charisma}
{1020}{}{No gun skills}
{1030}{}{No intelligence}
{1040}{}{Not talked to}
{1050}{}{Talked to}
{2000}{}{What is your business here?}
{2010}{}{Urr?}
{2020}{}{I'm just looking around.}
{2030}{}{I want to buy some equipment.}
{2040}{}{I'm running a campaign to increase the number of hugs in the wasteland, would you like a free hug..?}
{3000}{}{A comedian, huh? Fuck off, I have no time for your inane faggotry.}
{4000}{}{You may smell like a brahmam, but they're obviously more intelligent than you are. Get the hell out of here!}
{5000}{}{I see, very good. Talk to Ralph, he'll set you up with anything you need.}
{6000}{}{I don't like nosy people. Go away blow your head off.}
{7000}{}{Yeah, I remember you.  Go on in.}
{7010}{}{Say, would you know what this red button on the laser rifle do?}
{7020}{}{Say, how do I eject the extended mags from this laser rifle?}
{7030}{}{On my way.}
{8000}{}{What the hell is wrong with your face? You look worse than a mutant! Get the fuck out of here you freak!}
{9000}{}{I can tell just by looking at you that you've no skill whatsoever, come back when you've trained some.}
{10000}{}{That will take some time. My time! But you for 1000 caps, I'll give you some pointers on energy weaponry.}
{10010}{}{Let's play! [Swap Tag skill to Energy Weapons]}
{10020}{}{Thanks, but I have changed my mind.}
{11000}{}{Look, if you were long enough in this business as I am, you'd know it yourself already. Now, all I usually do is... [Listen to Alexei and learn]}
{11010}{}{Thanks, I really needed this,}

